<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Liz Claiborne started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Liz Claiborne started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it initiated coverage of Liz Claiborne Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Liz Claiborne gained 1-1/4 to 41-3/8 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
